{"id":851673,"title":"热点答疑：DeepSeek R1卡顿问题如何解决，如何部署?","content":"DeepSeek R1在使用过程中出现卡顿问题，主要由五个原因造成：服务器负载过高、算力不足、网络攻击、模型特性导致的资源消耗以及第三方平台限制。针对这些原因，有三种解决方案：一是使用云服务平台如腾讯云或阿里云，通过独享算力资源避免排队；二是本地部署，但需要较高配置的硬件支持；三是使用第三方服务，如硅基流动和Chatbox AI组合。对于小白用户，推荐使用Ollama进行本地部署，操作简单且可根据自身硬件条件选择合适的模型版本。此外，建议用户明确使用目的，合理利用资源，避免无意义的请求以减轻系统压力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398104,"user_name":"TsumetaiChiTrader","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1024522,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"7D9E42669FA7D3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a2/0a/50f3c331.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1740469546,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100968801,"comment_content":"《DeepSeek认知之旅》记录了DeepSeek V3&#47;R1相关的8篇核心论文，以及最新的NSA中论文中描述的关键要点，以时间顺序按脑图的形式整理到白板文件中，供大家学习使用。\n其中每篇论文的脑图都记录了对应的研究背景、核心贡献、研究方法以及一些非常重要的讨论和洞见，用全局视角从这份文件中或可窥得DeepSeek获得如此巨大成功的一些小线索。\n《DeepSeek认知之旅》文档链接：https:&#47;&#47;kcnrgc2yrax7.feishu.cn&#47;docx&#47;AJo5dVRS7ortyEx1OW8cX9KBngd?openbrd=1&amp;doc_app_id=501&amp;blockId=doxcncVubbqQeHtN9klREuWVgUQ&amp;blockType=whiteboard&amp;blockToken=KrGqwrZKDh2PkpbNR6hcWn2Rn7b#doxcncVubbqQeHtN9klREuWVgUQ","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":397744,"user_name":"天上星多月不亮","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1283877,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"A8CD6A7C094F0C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/97/25/8c35cc85.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739462159,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100968801,"comment_content":"如何部署 671b 满血模型呢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1899314,"avatar":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/LalJD9ruYQI5zVM1GOCe4PjunIbbeeMiacFHC4TAj0DBVeialKt3vRCLs9dxn1vYXvfp8pgcyaeEQkh1nde1JoBQ/132","nickname":"jun","note":"","ucode":"3A9633CA1FE72E","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_me